msgid "MAC-PHY 集成适配层。"
msgstr "MAC-PHY integration adapter layer."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/phy/mac_interface.py:9
msgid "将 MAC 层帧对象与 PHY 层发射/接收流水线打通， 提供字节级到比特级的转换和完整的发收链路。"
msgstr ""
"Bridges MAC layer frame objects with PHY layer TX/RX pipelines, providing "
"byte-to-bit conversion and a complete link."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/phy/mac_interface.py:12
msgid "QoS 集成: QosLink 类封装了带 ARQ/HARQ/流控的端到端数据链路。"
msgstr ""
"QoS integration: QosLink class encapsulates an end-to-end data link with "
"ARQ/HARQ/flow control."

